    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Domville Square, Cherrywood, Dublin 18 – D18 W92H\r\n\r\n3 Bedroom | 3 Bathroom | Furnished | Private Garden | Parking | EV Charger\r\n\r\nProperty Description\r\n\r\nAn exceptional three-bedroom, three-bathroom home ideally located in the highly sought-after Cherrywood development in Dublin 18. Presented in excellent condition and finished to a very high standard throughout, this impressive property offers stylish, modern accommodation combined with an excellent quality of life in one of South Dublin’s most well-connected locations.\r\n\r\nThe property is fully furnished and ready for immediate occupation, making it an ideal home for someone looking for a spacious and contemporary property in a convenient location.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting hallway leading into the heart of the home. The property features a superb open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, creating a generous and versatile space for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen is fully integrated and fitted with a comprehensive range of high-quality appliances, ample storage and generous worktop space. Large windows allow an abundance of natural light into the living area, while the overall finish throughout the home is both stylish and practical.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from its own private en-suite bathroom. The remaining bedrooms are complemented by an additional contemporary bathroom, while a further bathroom/WC downstairs provides excellent convenience for residents and guests.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of this property is the private rear garden, providing a pleasant outdoor space for relaxing and entertaining during the warmer months.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from private parking and an electric vehicle charging point, a highly desirable feature for modern living.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nThree spacious bedrooms\r\nThree bathrooms\r\nMaster bedroom with en-suite\r\nBright open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\nFully integrated modern kitchen\r\nHigh-quality appliances\r\nFully furnished\r\nFinished to an excellent standard throughout\r\nPrivate rear garden\r\nPrivate parking\r\nElectric vehicle charging point\r\nExcellent energy-efficient modern home\r\nSituated in the popular Cherrywood development\r\nExcellent public transport and road connections\r\nLocation\r\n\r\n3 Domville Square enjoys an enviable position in Cherrywood, Dublin 18, offering an excellent balance of modern residential living, green spaces and convenient access to Dublin City and the surrounding South Dublin suburbs.\r\n\r\nThe property is within easy walking distance of the Luas Green Line, with Laughanstown and Cherrywood Luas stops providing direct access towards Dublin city centre and other key destinations. There are also a number of Dublin Bus services operating in the surrounding area.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the M50 and N11 are both within easy reach, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin Airport, the city centre and locations throughout Dublin and Wicklow.\r\n\r\nSchools & Education\r\n\r\n Cherrywood Educate Together National School located locally in Tully Park. Blackrock Educate Together Secondary School is also located in the Cherrywood area, while a range of established primary and secondary schools are available throughout the wider Dublin 18 and South Dublin area.\r\n\r\nParks & Recreation\r\n\r\nCherrywood benefits from an abundance of landscaped green areas, communal open spaces and children's play areas, making it an attractive location for those who enjoy an active lifestyle. The wider area provides easy access to Cabinteely Park, Killiney Hill Park and Kilbogget Park, as well as numerous walking and cycling routes.\r\n\r\nThere are also a variety of sporting and leisure facilities nearby, including gyms, sports clubs, golf and tennis facilities.\r\n\r\nShopping & Amenities\r\n\r\nEveryday conveniences are close at hand, with local shops and services within the Cherrywood area, while Cornelscourt Shopping Centre, The Park Carrickmines and Dundrum Town Centre provide a much wider selection of supermarkets, retailers, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities.\r\n\r\nThe nearby Cabinteely and Foxrock areas also offer an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars and local services.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, finish and exceptional location of this superb home."
      },
